   (Q,P)=(53,84): theta_f = +0.001506; |R(Q/2)| =    211.32; max on line    3860.94 at f = 26.50361 (Q/2 +0.00361); predicted f_peak shift theta_f/(2-theta) = +0.00363, THM-4629 drift +0.00361; height (2-theta)^2/(2 pi^2 theta_f^2) =    3846.27; 2/((2-theta)|Re w|) =    3882.18; bound theta^2/(4 theta_f^2) =  276804.31
