# Part 4c: the proved line bound |R(2 pi i f)| <= pi^2/(phi^2 + psi^2) <= theta^2/(4 theta_f(f)^2) on a dense grid (tau parity, m = 2):
#   phi = principal 2 pi (1/2 - f), psi = principal 2 pi (1/2 + f (theta - 1)), theta_f(f) := (psi + (theta - 1) phi)/(2 pi) = (Q theta - P)/2 for the integers Q, P (Q odd, P even) fixed by f
   grid of 4000001 frequencies in (0, 400]: max |R| = 90191.56 at f = 332.5001; violations of |R| <= pi^2/(phi^2+psi^2): 0; of pi^2/(phi^2+psi^2) <= theta^2/(4 theta_f^2): 0
   min over the grid of (bound theta^2/(4 theta_f^2)) / |R| = 2.007 (at f = 306.0025)

